{"unit_id":"Okkay712__DSH-dseyes#card-zh","repo":"Okkay712/DSH-dseyes","commit":"bdf30a509b50e76e2aaacd9afb6febfbe19d83d1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-dseyes 为 DSH Web 聊天加入图片理解能力：图片附件可以进入会话，host 会调用智谱 GLM 视觉模型生成描述，并在文本模型请求发出前用描述替换图片内容。用户可以直接粘贴或拖入图片提问，需配置 GLM_API_KEY 或 ZHIPU_API_KEY。 图片描述失败时会以说明文本继续对话，并支持视觉模型回退与结果缓存。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:343-369","src/index.js:72-84"]}
{"unit_id":"Okkay712__DSH-dseyes#card-en","repo":"Okkay712/DSH-dseyes","commit":"bdf30a509b50e76e2aaacd9afb6febfbe19d83d1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH-dseyes adds image understanding to DSH Web chats. The host describes image attachments with Zhipu GLM, then replaces image blocks with text before dispatching requests to a text model. A GLM_API_KEY or ZHIPU_API_KEY is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:343-369","src/index.js:72-84"]}
