{"unit_id":"Okkay712__DSH-dseyes#feature-1","repo":"Okkay712/DSH-dseyes","commit":"bdf30a509b50e76e2aaacd9afb6febfbe19d83d1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-dseyes 的功能「聊天图片理解」：让图片附件进入 DSH Web 会话，并在模型请求前用视觉模型生成描述、替换图片内容。用户粘贴或拖入图片并发送消息，DeepSeek 根据描述作答。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:343-369","src/index.js:253-282"]}
{"unit_id":"Okkay712__DSH-dseyes#feature-2","repo":"Okkay712/DSH-dseyes","commit":"bdf30a509b50e76e2aaacd9afb6febfbe19d83d1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-dseyes 的功能「截图文字识别」：视觉 API 支持 OCR 模式，按预设提示逐字转写图片文字。调用识图路由时传入 mode 为 ocr 即可取得文本结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:37-39","src/index.js:404-415"]}
{"unit_id":"Okkay712__DSH-dseyes#feature-3","repo":"Okkay712/DSH-dseyes","commit":"bdf30a509b50e76e2aaacd9afb6febfbe19d83d1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-dseyes 的功能「本机诊断」：提供只接受 loopback 请求的 GET 诊断路由，检查本机是否找到 key 并查询智谱 API 连通状态，返回 JSON 状态信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:287-302","src/index.js:371-384"]}
{"unit_id":"Okkay712__DSH-dseyes#caveat-1","repo":"Okkay712/DSH-dseyes","commit":"bdf30a509b50e76e2aaacd9afb6febfbe19d83d1","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-dseyes 会将会话中的图片数据和识图提示发送到 open.bigmodel.cn 的视觉 API，以生成供文本模型使用的描述。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:112-125","src/index.js:223-225"]}
